<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-taoyuanmingji" book-id="b-taoyuanmingji-006" chapter-id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia" source-id="s-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia">
  <p id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:head" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">君諱<persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:head:m0002" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">嘉</persName>，字<persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:head:m0005" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">萬年</persName>，江夏鄂人也。曾祖父<persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:head:m0017" ref="edv_7cp_cl8">宗</persName>，以孝行稱，仕吳司馬。祖父<persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:head:m0031" ref="xsy_ds3_06u">揖</persName>， 元康中爲廬陵太守。<persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:head:m0043" ref="edv_7cp_cl8">宗</persName>葬武昌新陽縣，子孫家焉，遂爲縣人也。</p>
  <p id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:marriage" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">君少失父，奉母、二弟居。娶大司馬長沙桓公<persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:marriage:m0020" ref="twd_erg_kmz">陶侃</persName>第十女，</p>
  <p id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:last-illness" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:last-illness:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>從容謂君曰：「人不可無勢，我乃能駕御卿。」後以疾終於家，年五十一。</p>
  <p id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:author" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-taoyuanmingji-006-jin098-mengjia:author:m0000" ref="h19_ylm_y5p">淵明</persName>先親，君之第四女也。</p>
</text>
